nd the songs they have lost","with a glade where the seasons meet","where the paths rearrange themselves each dawn","home to a reclusive order of tree-singers","where fireflies spell out warnings for lost children","with a well that echoes voices from the future","where griffins nest in the tallest pines","where every stream leads back to the same clearing","known for a crown of antlers found in its heart","where even the wind seems to whisper your name kindly"],"elven":["where the elves sing the stars awake each evening","with halls woven from living branches","where no blade may be drawn beneath the leaves","guarded by archers who have not missed in a thousand years","where the moonlight lingers until noon","home to the oldest of the elven houses","with bridges of silver rope between the treetops","where time passes slowly, and visitors rarely leave","known for its great library of carved leaves","where the elves keep the last seeds of the first trees","with a lake so clear it shows the sky at midnight","where the old queen is said to still walk at dusk","guarded by wardens who speak with the birds","where harps hang in the branches and play in the wind","home to a court that meets only at midsummer","with lanterns of pale blue fire along every path","where outsiders may enter only by invitation","known for the white deer that carry the elven princes","where the trees remember every song sung beneath them","with a shrine to the stars at its highest point","where the elves first woke, so the old songs say","home to healers famed in every kingdom","where the leaves stay green through the deepest winter","with a hidden gate that opens only at twilight","where every elf child plants a tree on their naming day","guarded by enchantments older than the mountains","known for its silver-barked trees and quiet rivers","where the borders shift to keep strangers out","with a great hall carved inside a single tree","where the elves keep watch for an enemy long forgotten"],"dark":["where no birds sing, even at midday","where travellers hear their own names called from the trees","haunted by the knights who fell there long ago","where the mist never lifts","with a path that always leads back to the same dead oak","where wolves with silver eyes keep watch","where a witch's cottage appears only on moonless nights","known for lights that lead the unwary into the bog","where the trees lean in to listen","cursed by a sorceress who was never thanked","where the shadows move a little slower than they should","with a ruined chapel at its heart","where the ravens remember every face","which has swallowed three search parties","where the old king's hunting party was never found","where the snow falls black in winter","with roots that tangle round the ankles of the careless","where nobody goes after the bell tolls at dusk","home to a hermit who has not spoken in forty years","where the leaves rustle when there is no wind","known for its standing stones that are never in the same place twice","where the woodcutters' axes go missing overnight","where a grey lady walks the paths at midnight","with a well that whispers when you lean over it","where the mushrooms glow a sickly green","which the village children dare each other to enter","where lanterns go out by themselves","with a gate that should never be opened","where the trees grow in strange, perfect rings","known for the sound of hoofbeats on still nights"],"english":["where the bluebells carpet the ground each May","coppiced for hazel since the Domesday Book","with a badger sett older than the parish church","once a royal hunting ground for the Norman kings","where the charcoal burners worked until the last war","with a public footpath and a very muddy stile","where the village holds its May Day picnic","known for its ancient pollarded oaks","on a steep hillside above the river","where the nightingales sing in early summer","with the remains of a Roman road running through it","where foxes and fal